---
import "mdui/mdui.css";
import "../../styles/color-preview.css";
import { withBase } from "../../../website.config.mjs";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" class="mdui-theme-auto">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Nekomi 配色示意</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Nekomi 自定义配色的独立示意预览。" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={withBase("nekomi-icon.svg")} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="palette-preview" id="palette-preview">
      <header class="preview-identity">
        <div class="preview-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
          山
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1>山间笔记</h1>
          <p>记录技术，也记录日常。</p>
        </div>
        <span class="preview-mode" data-preview-mode>
          跟随系统
        </span>
      </header>
      <div class="preview-navigation" aria-label="预览内容类型">
        <span aria-current="page">全部文章</span>
        <span>分类</span>
        <span>归档</span>
      </div>
      <article class="preview-post preview-latest">
        <div class="preview-meta">
          <span class="preview-category">随笔</span>
          <span>示例内容</span>
        </div>
        <h2>把日常写成喜欢的样子</h2>
        <p>从一份配置和一篇 Markdown 开始，给想法留一点安静的空间。</p>
        <div class="preview-post-bottom">
          <span class="preview-tag">生活</span>
          <mdui-button variant="text" data-preview-read>
            展开正文片段
          </mdui-button>
        </div>
        <p data-preview-excerpt hidden>
          一段舒适的文字，不只需要漂亮的颜色，也需要清楚的层级和适当的留白。
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="preview-post">
        <div class="preview-meta">
          <span class="preview-category secondary">笔记</span>
          <span>示例内容</span>
        </div>
        <h2>为下一次灵感，留一页空白</h2>
        <p>标题、正文、标签与按钮使用同一套 Material 语义色。</p>
        <div class="preview-post-bottom">
          <span class="preview-tag">Markdown</span>
          <mdui-button variant="tonal" data-preview-note aria-expanded="false">
            查看配色笔记
          </mdui-button>
        </div>
      </article>
      <aside class="preview-note" data-preview-note-content hidden>
        <strong>配色笔记</strong>
        <p>
          主色控制强调与容器色。辅助色是经 MDUI 协调后的色组，不直接把输入 HEX
          同时涂在浅深背景上。
        </p>
      </aside>
      <footer class="preview-roles" aria-label="色板角色示例">
        <span class="role-primary">Primary</span>
        <span class="role-secondary">Secondary</span>
        <span class="role-surface">Surface</span>
      </footer>
    </main>
    <noscript>
      <p>实时配色需启用 JavaScript。</p>
    </noscript>
    <script>
      import "../../scripts/color-preview.ts";
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
